# A dead bot's trail sinks into the floor (game/rider.h). The player U-turns back towards the
# middle, then START, X x6, START shrinks the arena to 4000 across: the bot, 2000 out to the side, is pulled
# inside the wall (a crash) and dies; the player, heading back to the middle, doesn't.
# Iso, 0.25 s apart.
wait 17
press right
wait 0.2
press right
wait 0.3
press down
press start
press x 6
press start
shot sink_1
wait 0.25
shot sink_2
wait 0.25
shot sink_3
wait 0.25
shot sink_4
wait 0.25
shot sink_5
wait 0.25
shot sink_6
